<title>UK: Sedgwick profits up, says confident for '97.</title>
<headline>Sedgwick profits up, says confident for '97.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>British based insurance broker Sedgwick Group on Tuesday reported a five percent increase in full-year profits and said it was looking forward to 1997 with confidence.</p>
<p>Pre-tax profits for the twelve months to December 31 rose to 95.5 million pounds ($154.7 million) on brokerage and fees four percent higher at 914.9 million pounds.</p>
</text>
